### Login da gestão (troque pelas credenciais do seed/users.json)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "gestao",
  "password": "troque-esta-senha"
}

# @lang=lua
> {%
  local body = vim.json.decode(response.body)
  client.global.set("token", body.token)
%}

### Trilha de auditoria completa
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Só tentativas de login que falharam
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/events?type=user.login_failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
